use. To make matters worse, the ring is trapped in the hair of a migratory youkai, and Nyanko-sensei is unable to use his powers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i1QzIaBe3R1BtQNcRC2Z21XCLvr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1QzIaBe3R1BtQNcRC2Z21XCLvr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/4/episode/3"},{"id":"1316370","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Natsume is at home early one evening when he hears a knock on the door. He sees Tohko outside, asking to be let in. But when he opens the door, there's nobody there, and a gust of wind rushes past. Another Youkai is after the book of friends!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wVMtgbl5uRxzJOAWiEgI3Vd0yfz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wVMtgbl5uRxzJOAWiEgI3Vd0yfz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/4/episode/4"},{"id":"1316371","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An old classmate Yuriko, remembers her time watching Natsume and how he was a little weird. A clingbug from Natsume's past reminds him of the time he spent running from a youkai with a grudge.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-01-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2puVL1UtyLBQS3UDKLaA3ZROemo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2puVL1UtyLBQS3UDKLaA3ZROemo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69500/season/4/episode/5"},{"id":"1316375","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":6,"title"